/*
 * Declares the MapInsertValue class.
 *
 * MapInsertValue represents an insertion operation on a map. The operator
 * assigns a value to a key within a map, creating or replacing the entry
 * associated with that key.
 *
 * Example:
 *
 *     map[key] = value;
 *
 * This operation has side effects, as it mutates the map.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::map::insert
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/map/insert.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2024-11-15
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
